OL,3,GNEWSAEurope's security 'fundamentally
OL,4,Areshaped' by war in Ukraine
OL,5,
OL,6,FEurope's security has been
OL,7,F"fundamentally reshaped" by Russia's
OL,8,Fwar in Ukraine, Taoiseach (Irish prime
OL,9,Fminister) Micheal Martin has told 50
OL,10,Fleaders who are in Dublin for a summit.
OL,12,FThe Republic of Ireland is chairing the
OL,13,FEU presidency until the end of the year
OL,14,Fand its main showpiece events, the
OL,15,FEuropean Political Community (EPC) and
OL,16,Finformal meeting of the European
OL,17,FCouncil, are taking place this week.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,419,410,260,120,0,100
