OL,3,GNEWSAEurope's security 'fundamentally
OL,4,Areshaped' by war in Ukraine
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe country has been preparing for the
OL,7,Fevents for months, with gardai (Irish
OL,8,Fpolice) carrying out the largest
OL,9,Fsecurity and policing operation in the
OL,10,Fhistory of the state.
OL,12,FAttendees include Ukrainian President
OL,13,FVolodymyr Zelensky and heads of state
OL,14,Facross the EU.
